  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Swikombiso swa khodi, JSON Schemas, na swikongomelo swa pholisi leyi hlayekaka hi matšhini swi nyikiwile layisense ehansi ka MIT License, handle ka loko ku vuriwile ku hambana. Mi nga swi tirhisa hi ku ntshunxeka eka masayiti ya n'wina.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Ndhawu yo hlanganisiwa yo kuma mfanelo",
  "Commercial Redistribution": "Ku Hangalasa hi Mabindzu",
  "Commercial use": "Ntirho wa Mabindzu",
  "Commercial use requires contact": "Ntirho wa mabindzu wu lava vulavurisano",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Yi lerisiwile endzhaku ka Bletchley AI Safety Summit naswona yi rhangeriwa hi Yoshua Bengio na vativi va tlulaka 100 lava humaka eka matiko ya kwalomu ka 30 kun'wana na UN, OECD na EU, xiviko lexi xo tiyimela xi hlanganisa vumbhoni bya sayense bya sweswinyana malunghana na vuswikoti na khombo ta AI ya le mahlweni-mahlweni — hi ku xiya leswaku switekimu swin'wana namuntlha swi nga lemuka loko swi ri karhi swi kamberiwa naswona swi cinca mahanyelo ya swona hi ku fambelana.",
