  "Convert rights declarations into a workable licensing market instead of a binary open/closed web.": "Hundzula swiboxo swa mfanelo swi va makete yo tirha ya tilayisense, ematshan'weni ya wepu leyi nga ni \"pfulekile kumbe pfarilwe\" ntsena.",
  "Copied ✓": "Swi Kopiwile ✓",
