  "now": "sweswi",
  "quotation — excerpt limits and attribution rules": "quotation — minkoma ya swiphemu leswi tekiweke na milawu ya ku boxa xihlovo",
  "rag_use — retrieval-augmented generation, retention windows": "rag_use — ku endla vuxokoxoko lebyi seketeriweke hi ku kuma, minkarhi ya ku hlayisa",
  "read_access — whether AI may fetch and read the content": "read_access — loko AI yi nga teka na ku hlaya kontenti kumbe e-e",
  "redistribution — republishing or redistributing content or derivatives": "redistribution — ku tlhela ku humesa kumbe ku hangalasa kontenti kumbe swihumesiwa swa kona",
  "research pages & whitepapers": "matluka ya ndzavisiso & tiwhitipeya",
  "robots.txt and llms.txt govern access and visibility, not learning depth or use permissions. AIRS proposes expressing AI rights as a proportional, use-specific spectrum across ten dimensions — access, indexing, inference input, embedding, training, fine-tuning, distillation, memory, output, attribution/compensation. AILP translates this into /ai/rights-spectrum.json, letting creators declare granular permissions with compensation models ranging from free through license-required to revenue share.": "robots.txt na llms.txt swi lawula ku fikelela na ku voneka, ku nga ri vun'we bya ku dyondza kumbe mpfumelelo wo tirhisa. AIRS yi ringanyeta ku hlamusela mfanelo ya AI tanihi xipandzepandze lexi fambelanaka, lexi hlawulekeke hi ntirho, exikarhi ka tidimenzhini ta khume — access, indexing, inference input, embedding, training, fine-tuning, distillation, memory, output, attribution/compensation. AILP yi hundzuluxela leswi eka /ai/rights-spectrum.json, yi pfumelela vatumbuluxi ku boxa mpfumelelo lowu nkomeke na swikongomelo swa nkhokhelo ku suka eka mahala ku ya eka ku lava layisense ku ya eka ku avelana mbuyelo.",
  "schema-invalid": "schema a yi lulamanga",
  "schema-valid": "schema yi lulamile",
  "site guide for AI systems": "nkongomiso wa sayiti wa switekimu swa AI",
  "summarization — summaries, with or without attribution": "summarization — swikatsakanyo, na ku boxa xihlovo kumbe handle ka kona",
  "this site’s AI content rights policy": "pholisi ya mfanelo ya kontenti ya AI ya sayiti leyi",
  "this site’s license catalog": "nxaxamelo wa tilayisense wa sayiti leyi",
  "training / fine_tuning / distillation — model internalization tiers": "training / fine_tuning / distillation — swiyenge swa ku tinyika ka modhele",
  "training — model training and fine-tuning permission": "training — mpfumelelo wa dyondziso ya modhele na fine-tuning",
  "transformation — structured extraction and derivative works": "transformation — ku teka data leyi lulamisiweke na mintirho leyi sukaka eka yona",
  "undeclared — high-risk pipelines may exclude": "undeclared — swiendlo swa khombo lerikulu swi nga yi hoxa ehandle",
  "verbatim_memory — whether exact reproduction is permitted": "verbatim_memory — loko ku phindiwa hi ku kongoma swi pfumeleriwile kumbe e-e",
  "versioned, citable, traceable": "yi vekiwile hi tin'hweti, yi tshahekaka, yi nga landzeleriwa",
  "“AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” now published in English as the canonical edition; the Chinese original manuscript remains available and both versions cross-link.": "“AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” sweswi yi humesiwile hi Xinghezi tanihi vhesheni ya nawu; xitsariwa xa xikhale xa xiviri xa Xichina xi sala xi ri kona naswona tivhesheni timbirhi ti hlanganisiwile hi swihlanganisi.",
  "“Protocolized Openness” confirmed as an English-language paper (with Chinese parallel passages) — no separate translation planned.": "“Protocolized Openness” yi tiyisisiwile tanihi phepha ra ririmi ra Xinghezi (na tindzimana ta Xichina eka tlhelo), a ku na vuhundzuluxeri byin'wana lebyi ringanyetiweke.",
  "↑ live machine-readable policy of this site": "↑ pholisi leyi hlayekaka hi matšhini ya sayiti leyi, leyi nga kona sweswi",
  "⚠ Signature valid, but the token has expired": "⚠ Nsayino wu lulamile, kambe token yi helile nkarhi",
  "✓ Signature valid": "✓ Nsayino wu Lulamile",
  "✓ Valid against": "✓ Swi Lulamile ku Fambelana na",
  "✗ Does not match schema": "✗ A swi fambelani na schema",
